.TH SDL_HAS_BUILTIN 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HAS_BUILTIN \- Check if the compiler supports a given builtin functionality.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_begin_code.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HAS_BUILTIN(x) __has_builtin(x)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This allows preprocessor checks for things that otherwise might fail to compile\[char46]
.PP
Supported by virtually all clang versions and more-recent GCCs\[char46] Use this instead of checking the clang version if possible\[char46]
.PP
On compilers without has_builtin support, this is defined to 0 (always false)\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

